---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---

<PageLayout
  title="About"
  eyebrow="About this site"
  description={`How ${SITE.name} approaches small-space decorating and organization guides.`}
  lede="Practical ideas for making a small home easier to use."
>
  <p>{SITE.name} publishes guides to organizing and decorating compact rooms. Our aim is to help readers assess their own space, compare options, and make changes they can maintain.</p>
  <p><a href={`/author/${SITE.authorSlug}/`}>{SITE.author}</a> contributes to the guides. Author information is limited to what we can verify; an illustrative site mark is used in place of a personal portrait.</p>

  <h2>How to use the guides</h2>
  <p>Room dimensions, building conditions, budgets, and household routines vary. Measure your own space, check product specifications, and follow manufacturer instructions before buying or installing anything. Where an article gives an example layout, treat it as an illustration rather than a tested project in your home.</p>

  <h2>Images and recommendations</h2>
  <p>Some articles use licensed stock photography for illustration. An image does not show a project built by this publication unless the article explicitly documents that project. Product links may earn a commission; see our <a href="/disclosure/">disclosure</a>.</p>

  <h2>Corrections</h2>
  <p>If a guide is unclear, an image is credited incorrectly, or a link stops working, please <a href="/contact/">contact us</a> with the page URL and the issue. We review corrections as the archive is maintained.</p>
</PageLayout>
